        4,
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jay%2C_New_York"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The original settlement, called Mallory’s Bush, honored early settler Nathaniel Mallory who arrived around 1797.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jay%2C_New_York"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Jay’s hamlet centers around the meeting point of the West and East Branches of the Ausable River.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jay%2C_New_York"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Wells Memorial Library and the Keith and Branch Ford Motors Factory and Showroom are listed on the National Register of Historic Places.",
